Provides a wrapper to the GraphicsMagick library; here with the
GraphicsMagick of the package GraphicsMagick in /usr/local/az.

PECL gmagick for php56 of azsupport/ports, built from ext/gmagick
of the release tarball of azsupport/php-src, which bundles it:
lib/php/20131226/gmagick.so. Off by default: imagick and gmagick must
not be loaded into one PHP (GraphicsMagick and ImageMagick have the
same function names), so its ini in etc/php56/conf.d comes with its
line commented out, and the installation makes the CLI profile gmagick
(etc/php56-gmagick: gmagick on, imagick off), run by php56-profile
gmagick <script>.
